MODULE: SystemLaneProgressLaneWaitsForSharedPool
TARGET: SystemLaneProgress
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the reserved lane is granted only while shared capacity is free, so a wedged shared pool starves system replays
PERTURBS: LaneOpportunity

--- FIND
        /\ status[r] = "queued" /\ role[r] = "System" /\ LaneFree > 0
--- REPLACE
        /\ status[r] = "queued" /\ role[r] = "System" /\ LaneFree > 0 /\ free > 0
--- END
